@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Sans
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam roundCorner 5
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam noteFontSize 9

title ST-05: Security Admin cấu hình Rule trong Policy (2026-10-05)

box "Security Admin" #D5E8D4
participant "Admin\nBrowser" as A
end box

box "Detection Engine" #FFF2CC
participant "Policy API" as PA
database "detection-db" as DDB
end box

A -> PA : **GET /api/v1/policies**
activate PA
PA -> DDB : SELECT policies\nORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DDB
DDB --> PA : [policy1, policy2]
deactivate DDB
PA --> A : **200 [{id, version, is_active, ...}]**
deactivate PA

A -> PA : **POST /api/v1/policies**\n(JSON body)
activate PA
PA -> PA : Validate JSON schema\n+ field names + operators
note right
  **Policy structure (v3.3):**
  {
    "version": "v1.1",
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "unusual_hour",
        "field": "hour_of_day",
        "operator": "not_between",
        "value": [7, 22],
        "weight": 0.30,
        "score": 0.80,
        "enabled": true
      }
    ],
    "config": {
      "weights": {"rule": 0.4, "ml": 0.6},
      "thresholds": {"low": 0.25, "medium": 0.50, "high": 0.75}
    }
  }
end note
PA -> DDB : INSERT policies\n(version, rules, config)
activate DDB
DDB --> PA : policy record
deactivate DDB
PA --> A : **201 Created {policy_id}**
deactivate PA

A -> PA : **POST /api/v1/policies/{id}/activate**
activate PA
PA -> DDB : UPDATE old_policy\n(is_active=false)
PA -> DDB : UPDATE new_policy\n(is_active=true, activated_at=NOW())
activate DDB
DDB --> PA : updated
deactivate DDB
PA --> A : **200 OK**
deactivate PA

note over PA
  **Activation is IMMEDIATE:**
  Next login will use the new policy.
  No restart or reload required.
end note

== Policy takes effect on next login ==

box "User (login)" #FFFFFF
participant "User" as U
participant "Core App" as CA
end box

U -> CA : **POST /auth/login**\n(username, password)
CA -> PA : **POST /internal/pre-token-check**\n(user_id, ip, ua, event_id)
PA -> DDB : SELECT active_policy\n(newly activated v1.1)
note right
  **New policy is used:**
  - "unusual_hour" rule: outside [7-22] → +0.80 × 0.30
  - Thresholds: high >= 0.75
end note
PA --> CA : {risk_level: HIGH,\nrequire_mfa: true}
CA --> U : **200 {mfa_required: true}**

legend bottom
  **6 valid rule fields:** hour_of_day, fail_count_24h, ip_change_rate_7d,
  new_device, average_login_interval_seconds, deviation_score

  **7 valid operators:** ==, !=, >, >=, <, <=, in, between, not_between
endlegend
@enduml
